{
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "label": "7 Days to Die sandboxes",
    "description": "How 7 Days to Die sandboxes deploy, and how to find the game.",
    "sandbox": {
        "deploy": {
            "defaultStrategy": "hardlink",
            "supportedStrategies": [
                "hardlink",
                "symlink",
                "direct"
            ],
            "modTargets": [
                {
                    "type": "game_mod",
                    "relPath": "Mods"
                }
            ],
            "notes": [
                "Mods that change game rules have to match on the server AND on every client connecting to it. A sandbox is per-machine, so a group playing together needs the same sandbox exported to each of them \u2014 the share code is what that is for.",
                "The game ships EasyAntiCheat and refuses to load Mods/ with it enabled. Turn it off in the launcher's options; this app cannot do it for you and will not pretend a modded launch is possible with it on.",
                "An alpha bump usually breaks every mod at once, because ModInfo.xml declares a game version the loader checks. Nothing here can detect that in advance \u2014 the game simply refuses the mod at startup and says so in the log."
            ]
        },
        "detect": {
            "steamAppIds": [
                "251570"
            ],
            "names": [
                "7 Days To Die",
                "7DaysToDie"
            ],
            "markers": [
                "7DaysToDie.exe",
                "7DaysToDie.x86_64",
                "Data/Config"
            ],
            "paths": {}
        },
        "presets": [
            {
                "id": "client",
                "label": "Client",
                "environment": "client"
            },
            {
                "id": "server",
                "label": "Dedicated server",
                "environment": "server",
                "strategy": "direct",
                "options": {
                    "maxPlayers": 8
                }
            }
        ],
        "options": [
            {
                "key": "maxPlayers",
                "label": "Player slots",
                "type": "int",
                "min": 1,
                "max": 64,
                "default": 8,
                "unit": "players",
                "environments": [
                    "server"
                ]
            },
            {
                "key": "worldName",
                "label": "World",
                "type": "text",
                "default": "Navezgane"
            },
            {
                "key": "launchArgs",
                "label": "Additional launch arguments",
                "type": "text"
            }
        ]
    }
}
